# Template. Copy to secrets.sops.env, fill in, encrypt:
#
#   cp secrets.sops.env.example secrets.sops.env
#   $EDITOR secrets.sops.env
#   sops -e -i secrets.sops.env
#
# Identifying values only. Credentials are NOT here — `bws run` injects them from Bitwarden
# Secrets Manager by name, so a secret named TAILSCALE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID in the futhark project
# arrives as that environment variable with nothing committed to point at it. See
# .taskfiles/tofu/Taskfile.yaml and docs/src/tofu/index.md.
TAILSCALE_TAILNET=example-tailnet.ts.net
